    <node id="&quot;WOODY ALLEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Woody Allen is a writer and director who wrote and directed both versions of 'Don't Drink the Water', and also appeared in the 1994 remake as Walter Hollander."&lt;SEP&gt;"Woody Allen is the director of these films, known for his contributions to cinema."</data>
